ctricity than other products might not be a significant selling point. This would mean that the air conditioner might not sell more than other products, even though it uses less electricity.\n\nGiven this analysis, the option that best challenges the judgment of the company's management is D.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
